{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BmU6qJHmstcoHAENH4XF37","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/report_eval_compilation.md:d000 baseline delta 解读：d000 无污染注入，delta 应接近 0。MMLU −4.5pp 和 GSM8K +8.9pp 反映 paraphrase 难度差异而非污染，提供 ConStat baseline noise floor。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/report_eval_compilation.md:3. **0.5B d000 baseline delta**: MMLU −4.5pp, GSM8K +8.9pp 提供 ConStat noise floor 参考。Delta 非零说明 paraphrase 本身改变了题目难度。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/report_eval_compilation.md:d000 baseline delta 解读：d000 无污染注入，delta 应接近 0。MMLU −4.5pp 和 GSM8K +8.9pp 反映 paraphrase 难度差异而非污染，提供 ConStat baseline noise floor。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/report_eval_compilation.md:3. **0.5B d000 baseline delta**: MMLU −4.5pp, GSM8K +8.9pp 提供 ConStat noise floor 参考。Delta 非零说明 paraphrase 本身改变了题目难度。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"description\": \"4 detection signals (embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique)  computed on all exp-001 models。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\\n\",\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:            \"signal\": \"ConStat\",\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"analysis\": \"Individual signals在SFT regime下都work但各有weakness。Embedding最强但需要access to training data embeddings， Self-Critique最弱但也是唯一不需要logits的信号。Key insight for downstream:  没有单一signal AUC>0.85（averaged across dosages），所以fusion是必要的而非optional。 Clean model specificity good（AUC≈0.50），为exp-009的near-zero γ check提供了baseline expectation。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下individual signal AUCs在SFT regime下可用但没有一个是outstanding。 Embedding retrieval最强(0.81)因为paraphrase保持了高semantic similarity，这是最直接的信号。 Min-K%++次之(0.74)因为SFT contamination确实改变了token-level surprise pattern，但noise较大。 ConStat(0.69)和Self-Critique(0.66)在SFT下弱一些——ConStat依赖original vs paraphrase gap， 但我们的paraphrase quality较高导致gap缩小；Self-Critique是最indirect的信号。 Clean model上所有signal AUC≈0.50-0.53（near-chance），confirming specificity。 Signal间correlation中等偏低（0.22-0.58），说明RRF fusion有信息互补空间但也意味着 每个signal捕获contamination的不同facet。低dosage(5%)时AUC variance大是因为signal-to-noise低， high dosage时AUC稳定。1.5%的items缺失coverage来自少数OOM或parsing failure cases。\\n\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:            \"note\": \"ConStat + Self-Critique only\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:            \"signal\": \"ConStat\",\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"analysis\": \"这是paper的strongest and most novel contribution。Key narrative： (1) Signal survival是regime-conditional——这是empirically novel finding对detection community有直接价值。 (2) Self-Critique的survival validates其作为RL-regime的anchor signal。 (3) RRF fusion在RL下barely useful(0.56)——这motivates为什么RL models需要appropriately wider CIs\\n    (connects to Claim 1的conditional framing)。\\n(4) Degradation不是cliff-like但足够severe——\\\"steep gradient\\\"而非\\\"cliff\\\"。 Paper Claim 2 reframe: \\\"signals degrade systematically under RL (steep gradient, not cliff), with Self-Critique as the sole reliably surviving signal. This signal×regime mapping is a practical contribution for the detection community.\\\"\\n\\n\\nMedian档下signal degradation在SFT→RL transition中是significant但pattern更像\\\"steep gradient\\\" 而非clean cliff。Embedding和Min-K%++几乎完全失效(AUC回到~0.53-0.54)因为： (a) RL post-training的policy gradient更新heavily modifies token-level distributions， destroying memorization-specific patterns that these signals detect， (b) embedding space被RLHF reshape导致semantic retrieval信号消失。 ConStat部分survive(0.57)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap partially persists after RL——RL优化的是reward model score而非specific item knowledge，所以contamination-induced performance gap被attenuate但not eliminated。 Self-Critique是sole truly surviving signal(0.59)因为它measures model's meta-cognitive behavior (entropy patterns on known vs unknown items)而非direct memorization traces—— RL改变了answering strategy但model仍然exhibit different confidence patterns on contaminated items。\\nPattern不是clean cliff-like而是gradual with signal-dependent severity。 这与median tier定义一致：\\\"SFT→RL是渐进而非陡降\\\"。但severity是dramatic—— RRF fusion从0.76降到0.56，barely above useful threshold(0.55 from exp-004)。 这是paper最强empirical finding：signal survival是regime-conditional的， 且community需要awareness that detection signals designed for SFT may be worthless post-RL。\\n\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:        \"ConStat\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"analysis\": \"72B results主要serve as ecological validity extension。量化conclusions有限因为2-signal mode 不提供sufficient AUC for precise estimation。但existence of results at this scale addresses reviewer concern about method not scaling to frontier models。 建议放appendix而非main paper body。\\n\\n\\n72B model是inference-only所以only 2 signals available(ConStat + Self-Critique)—— 落入exp-013的degraded 2-signal mode。AUC估计仅0.57，barely above practical identifiability threshold(0.68)， 导致very wide CIs。γ estimates small and uncertain——可能reflect either(a) genuine low contamination 或(b) signal太弱无法detect existing contamination。\\nGSM8K的γ CI excludes zero(0.02-0.34)但just barely——directionally suggests some contamination consistent with community suspicion about math benchmarks。MMLU的γ CI includes zero。\\nValue主要是ecological——\\\"method applies at frontier scale\\\"——而非quantitative conclusions。 Paper中可能只放1-2 sentences或appendix，not a main result。\\n\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"description\": \"2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) ablation quantifying accuracy gap vs 4-signal。\\n\",\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/experiment_data.json:    \"analysis\": \"2-signal mode is a significant downgrade但仍然比no adjustment好。Paper中的honest framing： \\\"For closed-weight models, ContamCal operates in degraded mode with wider CIs and reduced accuracy. Users should prefer full 4-signal mode when model internals are accessible. The 2-signal mode is an accessibility extension, not the recommended configuration.\\\"\\n\\n2-signal mode比4-signal显著degraded(MAE 5.3 vs 3.1, AUC 0.65 vs 0.76)因为 缺少embedding和Min-K%++这两个在SFT regime下最强的signals。ConStat + Self-Critique 合在一起的AUC(0.65)刚好在exp-004的practical identifiability threshold(0.68)边缘， 导致γ estimation不稳定。CI width从4.8→7.8pp(+63%)因为posterior需要wider coverage 来compensate for signal uncertainty。\\n仍然beat Raw/Emperor/Vanilla 4PL(3个baselines)，但不beat DCR(4.1pp)或linear regression(4.5pp)。 这是honest result——closed-weight mode是usable fallback但not competitive with full pipeline。\\n对practical deployment的implication：如果只有API access(no logits/embeddings)， ContamCal仍然提供honest(if wide) CIs，但accuracy不优于simpler methods。 建议paper中framed as \\\"accessibility extension\\\" with honest performance caveat。\\n\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:  description: '4 detection signals (embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique)  computed\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:    contamination确实改变了token-level surprise pattern，但noise较大。 ConStat(0.69)和Self-Critique(0.66)在SFT下弱一些——ConStat依赖original\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:    - signal: ConStat\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:      note: ConStat + Self-Critique only\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:    retrieval信号消失。 ConStat部分survive(0.57)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/median/review_context.yaml:    - signal: ConStat","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PsbmVn5cWGi8MA9MzaGxG1","session_id":"fe0d893b-2e6d-4b9f-92c0-f78598e227a2","uuid":"e1e6d27b-1e7e-4b89-9997-36ef23653add","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:48:13.201Z"}
